    <informations>Shelly Shutter — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O1 L L O2 S1 S2 N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-shutter
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_e3c7a758432fc04cc5fe2e805b9d7ec7aaf426dea0aa16797a08dcd1f21c4009/Shelly%20Shutter%20Gen3.jpg?cb=ec534dbfa1662467ba9e746fe51e9d1d
